language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario PlanCurrentStem.
condition PlanCurrentStemReady.
condition PlanCurrentStemContinue.
condition PlanCurrentStemReject.
outcome PlanCurrentStemCompleted.
outcome PlanCurrentStemRejected.
step PlanCurrentStemCorrelate.
step PlanCurrentStemFit.
step PlanCurrentStemFreeze.
step PlanCurrentStemCompute.
step PlanCurrentStemAccept.
step PlanCurrentStemPublish.
step PlanCurrentStemFailure.
step PlanCurrentStemSuccess.

condition PlanInputCurrent.
condition PlanInputStale.
step RetainPriorPlan.
outcome PriorPlanRetained.

PlanCurrentStem illustrates InspectBuckingAlternatives.
PlanCurrentStem exercises CurrentBuckingAdvice.
PlanCurrentStem starts-when PlanCurrentStemReady.
PlanCurrentStem starts-at PlanCurrentStemCorrelate.
PlanCurrentStemReady describes "Valid machine baseline and explicitly selected domain configuration are available.".
PlanCurrentStemContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
PlanCurrentStemReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
PlanCurrentStemCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
PlanCurrentStemRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
PlanCurrentStem preserves DomainTruthOwned.
PlanCurrentStem preserves DurableFactsRetained.
PlanCurrentStemCorrelate calls CorrelateStemSamples within BuckingService.
PlanCurrentStemCorrelate describes "Create coherent physical samples; no UI correlation.".
PlanCurrentStemCorrelate proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFailure when PlanCurrentStemReject.
PlanCurrentStemCorrelate proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFit when PlanCurrentStemContinue.
PlanCurrentStemFit calls FitProfileModel within BuckingService.
PlanCurrentStemFit describes "Apply supported taper model with sample/span gates.".
PlanCurrentStemFit proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFailure when PlanCurrentStemReject.
PlanCurrentStemFit proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFreeze when PlanCurrentStemContinue.
PlanCurrentStemFreeze calls FreezePlanningInput within BuckingService.
PlanCurrentStemFreeze describes "Capture complete input revision tuple.".
PlanCurrentStemFreeze proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFailure when PlanCurrentStemReject.
PlanCurrentStemFreeze proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemCompute when PlanCurrentStemContinue.
PlanCurrentStemCompute calls ComputeOneBest within BuckingService.
PlanCurrentStemCompute describes "Pure K1, separate from archive.".
PlanCurrentStemCompute proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFailure when PlanCurrentStemReject.
PlanCurrentStemCompute proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemAccept when PlanCurrentStemContinue.
PlanCurrentStemAccept calls AcceptPlanningResult within BuckingService.
PlanCurrentStemAccept describes "Compare current input/generation before authoritative publication.".
PlanCurrentStemAccept proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemPublish when PlanInputCurrent.
PlanCurrentStemPublish calls PublishBuckingState within BuckingService.
PlanCurrentStemPublish describes "Retain prior valid plan while new work is pending.".
PlanCurrentStemPublish proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemFailure when PlanCurrentStemReject.
PlanCurrentStemPublish proceeds-to PlanCurrentStemSuccess when PlanCurrentStemContinue.
PlanCurrentStemFailure finishes PlanCurrentStem with PlanCurrentStemRejected.
PlanCurrentStemSuccess finishes PlanCurrentStem with PlanCurrentStemCompleted.
PlanCurrentStemCorrelate receives MachineResponses through MachineServiceUpstream.
PlanCurrentStemPublish emits BuckingResponses through BuckingServiceUpstream.
PlanInputCurrent describes "Machine session, measurement/model/config input tuple and generation still match the frozen result.".
PlanInputStale describes "At least one relevant input revision/session/generation changed while work was running.".
PlanCurrentStemAccept proceeds-to RetainPriorPlan when PlanInputStale.
RetainPriorPlan finishes PlanCurrentStem with PriorPlanRetained.
PriorPlanRetained describes "Stale result discarded; prior valid plan retained with explicit pending/currentness metadata.".
